## Maplewood Asset I Consider Highest Risk

I consider the Electronic Health Record (EHR) system Maplewood's highest-risk asset because it stores protected health information for active patients. A compromise could expose confidential medical information and alter diagnoses, medications, or care plans, potentially affecting patient safety.

---

## My Analyst Role Takeaway

As a Tier 1 SOC analyst, my responsibility is to investigate alerts, collect and document evidence, and escalate suspicious activity to Tier 2 when it exceeds my authority or expertise. I should follow established procedures and avoid making unauthorized changes to production systems.

